  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU Support to Response, Recovery and Resilience in Borno State (3RBS)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The action aims to recover, rehabilitate and build the resilience of conflict affected people, communities and public sector institutions. Activities would include restoring basic services such as health, nutrition, WASH, solar powers.</narrative>
  </description>
